            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "What’s your name?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q1-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 1.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "How old are you?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q1-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 2
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "Where do you live?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q1-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 1.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "Now, let’s talk about school. How do you usually get to school?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q1-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "What do you take with you to school?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q1-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 2.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "Now, please tell me something about your favourite teacher.",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q1-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 4.3
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "Now, let’s talk about parties. What do you usually eat at parties?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q1-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.3
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t8",
                "text": "Who do you go to parties with?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q1-t8.mp3",
                  "seconds": 2.6
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 30,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "part": 2,
      "label": "Part 2",
      "instruction": "Look at the pictures and talk about them with your partner. Then answer the examiner’s questions.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q2",
          "number": 2,
          "points": 15,
          "skills": [],
          "material": [
            {
              "id": "i1",
              "type": "imageRef",
              "image": "img1"
            }
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Look at the pictures of different types of exercise. Talk about them with your partner: say if you like them and why or why not. Then answer the examiner’s questions."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Here are some pictures that show different types of exercise. Do you like these different types of exercise? Say why or why not.",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 9.6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t10",
                "text": "I love swimming in a pool. It’s great on a hot day. Do you like swimming?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t10.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.2
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t11",
                "text": "Walking in the mountains is healthy, but it’s very tiring. Do you like walking?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t11.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.3
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t12",
                "text": "I think dance classes are hard, but they’re fun. Would you like to do a dance class?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t12.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t13",
                "text": "I often ride my bike in the park with my friends. Do you like cycling?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t13.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "Do you think swimming in a pool is nice? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "Do you think walking in the mountains is healthy? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "Do you think doing dance classes is hard? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "Do you think cycling is a good idea? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.4
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "Do you think exercising on a running machine is fun? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.3
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "So, which of these types of exercise do you like best?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 4.5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t8",
                "text": "Now, do you prefer doing exercise alone or with other people? Why?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t8.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t9",
                "text": "Do you enjoy doing exercise in the mornings? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t4-s-q2-t9.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.1
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 45,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
